{"unit_id":"tag:0D6W:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（sites）的态射（morphism）。再假设存在整数（integer）<MATH_0002>，使得\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> 满足情形 <REF_0001> 的假设，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005> 满足情形 <REF_0002> 的假设，\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006>，对 <MATH_0007> 和 <MATH_0008>，\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则对 <MATH_0009>，位于 <MATH_0010> 中的，映射（map）<MATH_0011> 为同构（isomorphism），对 <MATH_0012>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"本处由 ringed 限定"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"赋环位点间态射"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数","context":"导出直像的维数界"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"截断与导出直像的比较"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"指定次数中的比较性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EVX:title","translation":"Mayer-Vietoris","allowed_english":["Mayer-Vietoris"],"term_occurrences":[],"unknown_terms":[],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EVX:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n关于 Mayer-Vietoris 的通常陈述和证明，请见《上同调（Cohomology）》第 <REF_0001> 节。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0002>\n在范畴（category）<MATH_0003> 中。在此情形下，给定对象（object）<MATH_0004>，属于 <MATH_0005> 的，得到看起来像特殊三角（distinguished triangle）开端的\n<MATH_0006>\n下面的引理将其表述得更精确。\n\n","allowed_english":["Mayer-Vietoris"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层赋环位点"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"四对象的图"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"位点范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出对象"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"截面的三角候选"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0F16:statement","translation":"在上述情形中，选取 K-内射（injective）复形（complex）<MATH_0001>，由 <MATH_0002>-模（modules）组成，表示（representing）<MATH_0003>。对四个箭头（arrows）中的一个，使用 <MATH_0004> 倍的典范映射（canonical map），得到映射（maps），在复形（complexes）之间，\n<MATH_0005>\n满足 <MATH_0006>。于是有典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0007>\n此映射（map）为典范的（canonical），其意义是：另选 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），表示（representing）<MATH_0008> 的，将确定同构的（isomorphic）箭头（arrow），在导出范畴（derived category）中，其系数为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）。若 <MATH_0009> 为同构（isomorphism），则使用其逆（inverse），得到典范的（canonical）特殊三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0010>\n所有这些构造对 <MATH_0011> 都具有函子性（functorial）。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构的"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"导出对象代表"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构环上的模"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"复形代表导出对象"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头","context":"原四对象图中的箭头"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"截面及锥的比较映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"截面复形间映射"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"各对象上的截面复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"到锥的比较"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的","context":"比较箭头及特殊三角的典范性"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构的","context":"不同代表得到的箭头"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"导出范畴中的比较箭头"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"阿贝尔群的导出范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"截面复形的系数"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"锥比较映射的性质"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"比较映射的逆"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"Mayer-Vietoris 三角"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"构造对导出对象的函子性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0F16:proof","translation":"此引理本身便给出了证明。例如，若 <MATH_0001> 为第二个 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），表示（representing）<MATH_0002>，则可选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0003>，它确定所有涉及的复形（complexes）之间的拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）。省略细节。关于锥（cones）的构造及其与特殊三角（distinguished triangles）的关系，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》第 <REF_0001> 和 <REF_0002> 节。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"cones","target_term":"锥"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"另一个导出对象代表"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"复形代表导出对象"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"两代表的比较"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"各截面复形"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构","context":"各截面上的比较"},{"source_term":"cones","target_term":"锥","context":"映射锥的构造"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"锥与特殊三角的关系"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章名"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EWP:statement","translation":"在上述情形中，设 <MATH_0001> 为特殊三角（distinguished triangle），位于 <MATH_0002> 中。若 <MATH_0003> 为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），对两个 <MATH_0004>，取自 <MATH_0005> 的，则它也为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），对第三个 <MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"三个导出对象构成的三角"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"锥比较映射的性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EWP:proof","translation":"旋转（rotating）此三角（triangle），可以假设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）。选取映射（map）<MATH_0003>，在 K-内射（injective）复形（complexes）之间，其各项为 <MATH_0004>-模（modules），表示（representing）<MATH_0005>。则 <MATH_0006> 由 K-内射（injective）复形（complex）<MATH_0007> 表示（represented），见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0001>。于是态射（morphism）<MATH_0008> 为同构（isomorphism），因为它是映射（map）的第三条边（leg），在特殊三角（distinguished triangles）之间，位于 <MATH_0009> 中，其余两条边（legs）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）。省略一些细节；使用《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"rotating","target_term":"旋转"},{"source_term":"triangle","target_term":"三角"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"represented","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"leg","target_term":"边"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"legs","target_term":"边"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"rotating","target_term":"旋转","context":"三角的旋转"},{"source_term":"triangle","target_term":"三角","context":"给定的特殊三角"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构","context":"锥比较映射的性质"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"复形及特殊三角之间的映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射性质"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"前两个导出对象代表"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构环上的模"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"实际映射代表导出映射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"第三个导出对象代表"},{"source_term":"represented","target_term":"表示","context":"锥代表导出对象"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"第三个锥比较"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第三个比较的性质"},{"source_term":"leg","target_term":"边","context":"三角映射的第三分量"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"比较映射所在的三角"},{"source_term":"legs","target_term":"边","context":"三角映射的另两个分量"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EVX:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n给出此构造产生特殊三角（distinguished triangle）的一个判据。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"Mayer-Vietoris 构造的结果"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EVY:statement","translation":"在上述情形中，假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0001>，且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0002> 为单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则引理 <REF_0001> 的构造产生特殊三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0003>\n对 <MATH_0004>，位于 <MATH_0005> 中的，具有函子性（functorial）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"层间映射的性质"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"Mayer-Vietoris 三角"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"构造对导出对象的函子性"}],"notes":[]}
